 1. "x is #{x}" interpolates; 'x is #{x}' does not       "x is 5" "x is \#{x}"
 2. "#{obj}" calls to_s; nil, an Array, a Symbol, a Hash "Foo!" "|[1, 2]|sym|1.0|{a: 1}"
 3. any expression, even a nested string with its own #{} "3" "in 5"
 4. format("%05.2f", pi); "%.3e"; "%x %o %b %08b %X"     03.14; 1.235e+05; ff 10 101 00000101 FF
 5. "%+d % d" signs; "%5d|%-5d|" width and left-justify  +5  5;    42|42   |
 6. String#%: "%s and %s" % [a, b]; "%s" % one; "%d%%" % 50 a and b; one; 50%
 7. %p is inspect: "%p %s" % ["str", "str"]; %p and %s of nil "str" str; "nil||"
 8. named: "%{name} is %<age>d" with a Hash; "%<f>.2f"   Ada is 36; 3.14
 9. ljust(6, "."), rjust(6), center(6, "*"); "%-10s|"; "%10s|" ab....|     ab| **ab**| left      |      right|
10. 255.to_s(2), to_s(16); "ff".to_i(16), "ff".hex; "%#x %#o %#b" 11111111 ff; 255 255; 0xff 010 0b101
11. format("%.2f", 2.675) and 2.675.round(2); "%.0f" of 2.5, 3.5 2.68 2.68; 2 4
12. "%.10g" % (1/3.0); 1e20.to_s; 100.0.to_s; 1e-5.to_s  0.3333333333; 1.0e+20; 100.0; 1.0e-05
13. positional "%3$s %1$s %2$s"; width from an argument "%*d" c a b;    42|
14. a precision on %s truncates: "%.2s" % "abcdef"       ab
15. no thousands flag: "%,d" raises; the gsub idiom      ArgumentError: malformed format string - %,; 1,234,567
16. padding counts characters: "%-6s|" % "caf\u{e9}"; ljust café  | café..|
17. <<~ strips the common indentation; <<- keeps it      "indented\n  more\nback\n" "  kept\n"
18. "%c" of an Integer and of a String                   A h
19. format("%s", 3.0); ("%d", 3.99) truncates; ("%f", 3) 3.0; 3; 3.000000
20. an interpolated string is a new object: equal?; ==   false; true
